CORE
main.bash
--show-parse-tree
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^dialect bash$
^    assign e = arith"--x"\{\(--x\)\}$
^    assign i = arith"a = 1, b"\{\(\(a = 1\) , b\)\}$
^    assign j = arith"x\+\+"\{\(x\+\+\)\}$
^    assign k = arith"-- 3"\{\(-\(-3\)\)\}$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
bash arithmetic: increment operators, falling back to two sign operators
when the operand is not a variable, and the comma operator.
